<title>GERMANY: Rosenthal raises capital to give Wedgwood a stake.</title>
<headline>Rosenthal raises capital to give Wedgwood a stake.</headline>
<dateline>SELB, Germany 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German porcelain group Rosenthal AG said on Wednesday it planned to raise capital by 10 percent, saying this would enable Ireland's Waterford Wedgwood to take a stake in the group.</p>
<p>In a statement, Rosenthal said it had been seeking a strategic partner for some time and believed Dublin-based Waterford Wedgwood was an ideal choice.</p>
</text>
